{"id":"n53830-1-8","stage":1,"title":"갈아입다 · 换","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53830-1-8-1","ko":"운동을 했더니 옷이 더러워졌어.","zh":"我做了运动，衣服都弄脏了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"3","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"했더니","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했더니","audio":"/audio/bda5287494be17f016ed.mp3"}},{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"더러워졌어.","meaning":"变脏，污染","explanation":"더러워지다：变脏，污染；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"더러워지다","audio":"/audio/580925ef9a287643bdd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14367","senseId":"1","lemma":"더러워지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더러워졌어","audio":"/audio/111d5e1b7b277f74d2c8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"根据定好的规则和方法活动身体，较量能力或技术。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159"